<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  THE WIDGETS' PALETTE, LIGHT: the app's own (backend bots/palette.ts). White
  and ink with greys; colour belongs only to bots. values-night/ holds the
  dark one, role for role, so every widget, preview and shortcut icon follows
  the phone's light or dark theme.

  The widgets read these as their fallbacks (WidgetInk.palette); colours the
  server sends with the rows and the widget theme go over them.
-->
<resources>
    <!-- The card. -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_ground">#FFFFFF</color>
    <!-- Titles, a primary button's fill, the needs-you mark, the week's beads. -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_ink">#0A0A0A</color>
    <!-- Meta text: times, tags, a label. 9:1 on the worse of ground and surface (it was #5C5C5C, 6.1:1 on the surface grey). -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_meta">#434343</color>
    <!--
      Idle icons, a stage still to come. Words are set in it (the stage bar's names), so it is held at AAA rather than the
      AA floor: #535353 is 7.1:1 on the worse of the ground and the surface grey. #6E6E6E cleared 4.5:1 and still read as
      faded on a widget, which is small, glanced at, and often dimmed.
    -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_dim">#535353</color>
    <!--
      Hairlines between rows, a card's outline, the stage bar's track. A widget is read at a glance, over a wallpaper
      and often dimmed, so the app's own full-screen hairline was not there at all: #A7A7A7 is 2.4:1 on white (it was
      #E6E6E6, 1.3:1). Held to a hairline's 2.4:1, not a boundary's 3:1, because 48 of its uses are rules.
    -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_line">#A7A7A7</color>
    <!-- An avatar's ground, a shortcut icon's disc, the X0 widget's tiles, Ask and chips. -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_surface">#F5F5F5</color>
    <!--
      The X0 widget's open week bead. Open against filled IS the information, so it is held above the boundary floor:
      #828282 is 3.8:1 on white (it was #C9C9C9, 1.7:1, which read as no bead at all).
    -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_hollow">#828282</color>
    <!-- The X0 widget's secondary answer: a capsule's 1dp ring. A control boundary, so 3:1 (it was #D4D4D4, 1.5:1). -->
    <color name="tailzu_widget_outline">#949494</color>

    <!--
      The X0 picker preview's sample bots, Code bot and Travel bot, in their own colours (backend bots/art.ts); a touch lighter
      at night so they carry on the dark ground. On the placed widget a bot's colour is the server's.
    -->
    <color name="tailzu_x0_preview_code">#4F7A3A</color>
    <color name="tailzu_x0_preview_travel">#3E6E8E</color>
</resources>
